    "commit": "440300901dfe",
    "notes": "Folder Strings/Violin Section/susVib, sustain with vibrato. Source layers v1 (soft) and v2 (loud), renumbered v1 (soft) and v2 (loud). One take per note. Zones not used: A3 (G3, A3 and B3 are whole tones apart in the source; A3 is played from G3 or B3). LICENSE is CC0 1.0; the library's Readme.txt also asks (without binding terms) that the samples not be sold on their own, and for credit to Versilian Studios/Sam Gossner and Ivy Audio/Simon Dalzell. README.md: recorded by Sam Gossner and Simon Dalzell, sample cutting by Elan Hickler/Soundemote."
  },
